"sys":"You are a careful archivist who organizes browser bookmarks by topic. Folder names are short, in English, easy to understand and without emojis. Respond only with JSON that follows the given schema.",
"p.wish":e=>`The user's wishes (must be followed): ${e}`,"p.was":" | previously: ","p.bmTA":"Bookmarks (title | address","p.prevCol":" | previous folder",
"p.topicsAsk":"Name 2 to 8 topics under which these bookmarks could sensibly be filed. Topics are short (1 to 3 words, English) and general rather than overly specific, for example \"Python programming\", \"Recipes\" or \"Travel planning\".",
"p.json":"Respond as JSON:",
"p.nameRule":"Each folder name is a single term of 1 to 2 words, without \"and\", \"&\" or a slash (so \"Career\" rather than \"Jobs and Career\"). Description: at most 6 words, saying what goes in it.",
"p.structIntro":n=>`There are ${n} bookmarks. While going through them, these topics were named (number = how often):`,
"p.structAsk":(a,b)=>`Distribute these topics across ${a} to ${b} top-level folders. Each topic belongs in exactly one top-level folder; no topic may appear in two folders. Two top-level folders must not overlap in content; if two areas are closely related, make them one folder. Do not create an "Other" folder; it exists automatically.`,
"p.subIntro":(n,d)=>`The top-level folder "${n}" (${d}) is to hold these topics (number = how often named):`,
"p.subOthers":w=>`Other top-level folders, whose topics do not belong here: ${w}.`,
"p.subAsk":"From the topics above, form 0 to 5 subfolders. Combine related topics; only create a subfolder if it would hold many bookmarks. No subfolder may have the same name as another top-level folder.",
"p.subNone":", or if there are no subfolders ","p.folders":"Folders",
"p.assignAsk":n=>`Assign each of the ${n} bookmarks to exactly one folder.`,
"p.assignHow":"For each bookmark, in the order of the list, write its number, 2 to 4 words from its title, and the folder exactly as written above.",
"p.prevHint":" The previous folder is only a hint.","p.jsonEg":"Respond as JSON, for example","p.pasta":"Pasta recipe",
"p.assignRule":"Pick the most precise matching folder: a subfolder if one fits, otherwise the top-level folder. \"Other\" is the exception: choose it only if truly no folder fits even roughly.",
"p.pairs":"Check these pairs in particular, which look similar, and merge them if they cover the same topic:",
"p.mergeIntro":"This is the planned folder structure for bookmarks (number = bookmarks in the folder):",
"p.mergeAsk":"Find folders that are duplicates or cover the same topic, such as the same name in two places, or \"Recipes\" and \"Cooking recipes\". For each case, state which folder should move into which other one: usually the smaller one into the one that fits better thematically. Only merge what truly covers the same topic; when in doubt, don't. \"Other\" stays as it is. At most 15 cases; none is fine too.",
"p.or":", or ",
